{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09997","headline":"七夕泛舟 · 梁鍠","name":"七夕泛舟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云端有灵匹，掩映拂妆台。\n夜久应摇佩，天高响不来。\n片欢秋始展，残梦晓翻催。\n却怨填河鹊，留桥又不回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"梁鍠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09997.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09997","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}